{"study_accession":"PRJNA540246","secondary_study_accession":"SRP194123","title":"The Developmental Heterogeneity of Human Natural Killer Cells Defined by Single-cell Transcriptome","description":"The heterogeneity of human NK cells has not been fully-defined. Using single-cell RNA-sequencing technology, we find more human NK subsets than previously defined by cell surface markers. The transcriptome-based pseudotime analysis support that CD56bright NK cells are precursors of CD56dim NK cells with identification of a transitional stage. Our data significantly expand our understanding of the heterogeneity and development of human NK cells. Overall design: Single-cell RNA-sequencing analysis of NK cells from bone marrow of six healthy donors, blood of two healthy donors and a blood sample from a donor with GATA2T354M mutation","pubmed":"31477722","geo_series":"","n_samples":9,"samples":[{"sample_accession":"SAMN11526135","study_accession":"PRJNA540246","blood_class":"blood_cells","class_from":"sample","title":"GATA2T354M_F_PB","description":"GATA2T354M_F_PB","sex":"female","geo_sample":"GSM3738544","access":"open","dbgap":"","n_runs":4,"first_public":"2019-07-16","attributes":[["source_name","Blood"],["tissue","Blood"],["cell_type","NK cells"],["sorting population","Lin-CD7+"],["genotype","GATA2T354M"],["sex","female"]],"runs":[{"run_accession":"SRR8984463","experiment_accession":"SRX5763728","library_layout":"PAIRED","library_selection":"cDNA","instrument_model":"NextSeq 500","read_count":54472126,"base_count":5338268348,"first_public":"2019-07-16","experiment_title":"NextSeq 500 sequencing: GSM3738544: GATA2T354M_F_PB Homo sapiens RNA-Seq"},{"run_accession":"SRR8984464","experiment_accession":"SRX5763728","library_layout":"PAIRED","library_selection":"cDNA","instrument_model":"NextSeq 500","read_count":53597491,"base_count":5252554118,"first_public":"2019-07-16","experiment_title":"NextSeq 500 sequencing: GSM3738544: GATA2T354M_F_PB Homo sapiens RNA-Seq"},{"run_acces